{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42903","headline":"瑕瑜不相掩 · 武翊黄","name":"瑕瑜不相掩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱璞应难辨，妍媸每自融。\n贞姿偏特达，微玷遇磨砻。\n泾渭流终异，瑕瑜自不同。\n半曾光透石，未掩气如虹。\n缜密诚爲智，包藏岂谓忠。\n停看分美恶，今得值良工。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武翊黄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}